  "title": "More to build with",
  "summary": "July brought more model and image options, a busier community project directory, and quieter work on access, routing, and documentation.\n\nThe text lineup gained Llama, Mistral, Gemma, and GLM options, while OpenAI aliases changed backends. Anonymous access expanded for some models, and model availability and tier rules were adjusted.\n\nKontext joined image generation with reference-image support, then gained a route to larger outputs and a guidance control. An OpenAPI spec now documents the image endpoint without changing the API itself.\n\nGames, coding tools, chat interfaces, and prompt helpers joined the project lists. Link repairs, corrected credits, and refreshed tables made the existing work easier to find.\n\nToken-based image requests gained parallel capacity, shared queues brought text and image limits together, and authentication lookups received caching and indexing work. API examples and MCP setup documentation also improved.",
